          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence முடக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. நீங்கள் பின்னர் கணினி அமைப்புகளில் அதை இயக்கலாம்."
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence నిలిపివేయబడింది. మీరు దీన్ని తర్వాత సిస్టమ్ సెట్టింగ్‌లలో ప్రారంభించవచ్చు."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence ถูกปิดใช้งาน คุณสามารถเปิดใช้งานได้ในภายหลังในการตั้งค่าระบบ"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence devre dışı. Bunu daha sonra Sistem Ayarları'ndan etkinleştirebilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence вимкнено. Ви можете ввімкнути його пізніше в налаштуваннях системи."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence غیر فعال ہے۔ آپ اسے بعد میں سسٹم سیٹنگز میں فعال کر سکتے ہیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence bị tắt. Bạn có thể kích hoạt nó sau trong Cài đặt hệ thống."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 被禁用。您可以稍后在系统设置中启用它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 已停用。您可以稍後在系統設定中啟用它。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence est désactivé. Vous pourrez l’activer plus tard dans Réglages Système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is preparing. FileMailer will use its deterministic fallback in the meantime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "النموذج قيد الإعداد. FileMailer سيستخدم الإجراء الاحتياطي الحتمي في هذه الأثناء."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "মডেলের প্রস্তুতি চলছে। FileMailer এর মধ্যে ডিটারমিনিস্টিক ফলব্যাক ব্যবহার করবে।"
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El model està en preparació. Mentrestant, FileMailer utilitzarà una alternativa determinista."
          }
