    "On macOS 26, FileMailer offers deterministic drafting and manual drafting. Apple Intelligence is reserved for macOS 27 or later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur macOS 26, FileMailer propose un brouillon déterministe et la rédaction manuelle. Apple Intelligence est réservé à macOS 27 ou ultérieur."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26, FileMailer offers deterministic drafting and manual drafting. Apple Intelligence is reserved for macOS 27 or later."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26-এ, FileMailer ডিটারমিনিস্টিক ড্রাফটিং এবং ম্যানুয়াল ড্রাফটিং অফার করে। Apple Intelligence সংরক্ষিত macOS 27 বা তার পরে।"
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El macOS 26, FileMailer ofereix dibuixos deterministes i dibuixos manuals. Apple Intelligence està reservat per a macOS 27 o posterior."
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na macOS 26, FileMailer nudi determinističko crtanje i ručno crtanje. Apple Intelligence je rezerviran za macOS 27 ili kasnije."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na macOS 26 nabízí FileMailer deterministické kreslení a ruční kreslení. Apple Intelligence je rezervováno pro macOS 27 nebo novější."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "På macOS 26 tilbyder FileMailer deterministisk tegning og manuel tegning. Apple Intelligence er reserveret til macOS 27 eller nyere."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Op macOS 26 biedt FileMailer deterministisch opstellen en handmatig opstellen. Apple Intelligence is gereserveerd voor macOS 27 of later."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26:ssa FileMailer tarjoaa deterministisen piirtämisen ja manuaalisen piirtämisen. Apple Intelligence on varattu macOS 27:lle tai uudemmalle."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf macOS 26 bietet FileMailer deterministisches Zeichnen und manuelles Zeichnen. Apple Intelligence ist für macOS 27 oder höher reserviert."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Στο macOS 26, το FileMailer προσφέρει ντετερμινιστική σύνταξη και μη αυτόματη σύνταξη. Το Apple Intelligence έχει δεσμευτεί για macOS 27 ή μεταγενέστερο."
          }
        },
        "gu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 ના રોજ, FileMailer નિર્ણાયક ડ્રાફ્ટિંગ અને મેન્યુઅલ ડ્રાફ્ટિંગ ઓફર કરે છે. Apple Intelligence macOS 27 અથવા પછીના માટે આરક્ષિત છે."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ב-macOS 26, FileMailer מציע שרטוט דטרמיניסטי ושרטוט ידני. Apple Intelligence שמור עבור macOS 27 ואילך."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 पर, FileMailer नियतात्मक प्रारूपण और मैन्युअल प्रारूपण प्रदान करता है। Apple Intelligence 27 या बाद के संस्करण के लिए आरक्षित है।"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A macOS 26-án a FileMailer determinisztikus rajzolást és kézi rajzolást kínál. A Apple Intelligence a macOS 27. vagy újabb számára van fenntartva."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pada macOS 26, FileMailer menawarkan penyusunan deterministik dan penyusunan manual. Apple Intelligence dicadangkan untuk macOS 27 atau lebih baru."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su macOS 26, FileMailer offre la redazione deterministica e la redazione manuale. Apple Intelligence è riservato per macOS 27 o successivo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 では、FileMailer は確定的な製図と手動による製図を提供します。 Apple IntelligenceはmacOS27以降用に予約されています。"
          }
        },
        "kn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 ರಂದು, FileMailer ನಿರ್ಣಾಯಕ ಡ್ರಾಫ್ಟಿಂಗ್ ಮತ್ತು ಹಸ್ತಚಾಲಿತ ಡ್ರಾಫ್ಟಿಂಗ್ ಅನ್ನು ನೀಡುತ್ತದೆ. Apple Intelligence ಅನ್ನು macOS 27 ಅಥವಾ ನಂತರ ಕಾಯ್ದಿರಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26에서 FileMailer은 결정적 제도 및 수동 제도를 제공합니다. Apple Intelligence는 macOS 27 이상용으로 예약되어 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pada macOS 26, FileMailer menawarkan penggubalan deterministik dan penggubalan manual. Apple Intelligence dikhaskan untuk macOS 27 atau lebih baru."
          }
        },
        "ml": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26-ന്, FileMailer ഡിറ്റർമിനിസ്റ്റിക് ഡ്രാഫ്റ്റിംഗും മാനുവൽ ഡ്രാഫ്റ്റിംഗും വാഗ്ദാനം ചെയ്യുന്നു. Apple Intelligence എന്നത് macOS 27 അല്ലെങ്കിൽ അതിനു ശേഷമുള്ളവയ്‌ക്കായി റിസർവ് ചെയ്‌തിരിക്കുന്നു."
          }
        },
        "mr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 रोजी, FileMailer निर्धारक मसुदा आणि मॅन्युअल ड्राफ्टिंग ऑफर करते. Apple Intelligence macOS 27 किंवा नंतरसाठी राखीव आहे."
          }
        },
        "no": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "På macOS 26 tilbyr FileMailer deterministisk tegning og manuell tegning. Apple Intelligence er reservert for macOS 27 eller nyere."
          }
        },
        "or": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 ରେ, FileMailer ନିର୍ଣ୍ଣୟକାରୀ ଡ୍ରାଫ୍ଟ ଏବଂ ମାନୁଆଲ୍ ଡ୍ରାଫ୍ଟ ପ୍ରଦାନ କରେ | Apple Intelligence 27 କିମ୍ବା ପରେ ପାଇଁ ସଂରକ୍ଷିତ |"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W macOS 26, FileMailer oferuje kreślenie deterministyczne i kreślenie ręczne. Apple Intelligence jest zarezerwowane dla macOS 27 lub nowszego."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em macOS 26, FileMailer oferece desenho determinístico e desenho manual. Apple Intelligence está reservado para macOS 27 ou posterior."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em macOS 26, FileMailer oferece o desenho determinístico e o desenho manual. Apple Intelligence está reservado para macOS 27 ou posterior."
          }
        },
        "pa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 ਨੂੰ, FileMailer ਨਿਰਣਾਇਕ ਡਰਾਫ਼ਟਿੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਮੈਨੂਅਲ ਡਰਾਫ਼ਟਿੰਗ ਦੀ ਪੇਸ਼ਕਸ਼ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ। Apple Intelligence macOS 27 ਜਾਂ ਬਾਅਦ ਦੇ ਲਈ ਰਾਖਵਾਂ ਹੈ।"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pe macOS 26, FileMailer oferă redactare deterministă și redactare manuală. Apple Intelligence este rezervat pentru macOS 27 sau mai târziu."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "В macOS 26 FileMailer предлагается детерминированное черчение и черчение вручную. Apple Intelligence зарезервировано для macOS 27 или новее."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na macOS 26 ponúka FileMailer deterministické kreslenie a manuálne kreslenie. Apple Intelligence je rezervovaný pre macOS 27 alebo novší."
          }
        },
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na macOS 26 ponuja FileMailer deterministično risanje in ročno risanje. Apple Intelligence je rezerviran za macOS 27 ali novejšo."
          }
        },
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En macOS 26, FileMailer ofrece dibujo determinista y dibujo manual. Apple Intelligence está reservado para macOS 27 o posterior."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En macOS 26, FileMailer ofrece dibujo determinista y dibujo manual. Apple Intelligence está reservado para macOS 27 o posterior."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "På macOS 26 erbjuder FileMailer deterministisk ritning och manuell ritning. Apple Intelligence är reserverad för macOS 27 eller senare."
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 இல், FileMailer தீர்மானிக்கும் வரைவு மற்றும் கைமுறை வரைவு ஆகியவற்றை வழங்குகிறது. Apple Intelligence ஆனது macOS 27 அல்லது அதற்குப் பிறகு ஒதுக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது."
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26న, FileMailer నిర్ణయాత్మక డ్రాఫ్టింగ్ మరియు మాన్యువల్ డ్రాఫ్టింగ్‌ను అందిస్తుంది. Apple Intelligence macOS 27 లేదా తదుపరిది కోసం రిజర్వ్ చేయబడింది."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ในวันที่ macOS 26 FileMailer นำเสนอการร่างที่กำหนดและการร่างด้วยตนเอง Apple Intelligence สงวนไว้สำหรับ macOS 27 หรือใหม่กว่า"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26'da, FileMailer deterministik taslak oluşturma ve manuel taslak oluşturma olanağı sunar. Apple Intelligence, macOS 27 veya üzeri için ayrılmıştır."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "На macOS 26 FileMailer пропонує детерміноване та ручне складання. Apple Intelligence зарезервовано для macOS 27 або новішої версії."
          }
        },
        "ur": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 26 کو، FileMailer ڈیٹرمنسٹک ڈرافٹنگ اور مینوئل ڈرافٹنگ پیش کرتا ہے۔ Apple Intelligence macOS 27 یا بعد کے لیے مخصوص ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trên macOS 26, FileMailer cung cấp tính năng soạn thảo xác định và soạn thảo thủ công. Apple Intelligence được dành riêng cho macOS 27 trở lên."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26, FileMailer offers deterministic drafting and manual drafting. Apple Intelligence is reserved for macOS 27 or later."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26, FileMailer offers deterministic drafting and manual drafting. Apple Intelligence is reserved for macOS 27 or later."
          }
        },
        "en-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26, FileMailer offers deterministic drafting and manual drafting. Apple Intelligence is reserved for macOS 27 or later."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur macOS 26, FileMailer propose un brouillon déterministe et la rédaction manuelle. Apple Intelligence est réservé à macOS 27 ou ultérieur."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "في macOS 26، FileMailer يقدم صياغة حتمية وصياغة يدوية. Apple Intelligence محجوز لـ macOS 27 أو الأحدث."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 macOS 26 上，FileMailer 提供确定性绘图和手动绘图。 Apple Intelligence 保留给 macOS 27 或更高版本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
